{"path":"numeric/lcm","title":"std::lcm","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>lcm","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/lcm","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Computes the least common multiple of the integers m and n.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/numeric\">&lt;numeric&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> M, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> N <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/common_type\"><span class=\"kw641\">std::<span class=\"me2\">common_type_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>M, N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> lcm<span class=\"br0\">(</span> M m, N n <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Computes the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/least_common_multiple\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">least common multiple</a> of the integers <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code>.\n</p><p>If either <code>M</code> or <code>N</code> is not an integer type, or if either is (possibly cv-qualified) <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span></code>, the program is ill-formed.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">|</span>m<span class=\"sy3\">|</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">|</span>n<span class=\"sy3\">|</span></span></code>, or the least common multiple of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">|</span>m<span class=\"sy3\">|</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">|</span>n<span class=\"sy3\">|</span></span></code> is not representable as a value of type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/common_type\"><span class=\"kw641\">std::<span class=\"me2\">common_type_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>M, N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> m, n\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> integer values\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>If either <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m</span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code> is zero, returns zero. Otherwise, returns the least common multiple of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">|</span>m<span class=\"sy3\">|</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">|</span>n<span class=\"sy3\">|</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Throws no exceptions.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_gcd_lcm\"><code>__cpp_lib_gcd_lcm</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/17#cpp_lib_gcd_lcm_201606L\"><code>201606L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++17)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/gcd\">std::gcd</a></span>, <code>std::lcm</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;numeric&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"co2\">#define OUT(...) std::cout &lt;&lt; #__VA_ARGS__ &lt;&lt; \" = \" &lt;&lt; __VA_ARGS__ &lt;&lt; '\\n'</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> lcm<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> x, <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span>... <span class=\"me1\">xs</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">lcm</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x, xs<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, ...<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> p<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> q<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">lcm</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>p, q<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">225</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">lcm</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">45</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">75</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">lcm</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"nu0\">6</span>,  <span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">30</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">lcm</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"nu0\">6</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">30</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">lcm</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">6</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">30</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">lcm</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"nu0\">24</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">lcm</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">24</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    OUT<span class=\"br0\">(</span>lcm<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    OUT<span class=\"br0\">(</span>lcm<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">5</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">6</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    OUT<span class=\"br0\">(</span>lcm<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">5</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">6</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">6</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">7</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>lcm(2 * 3, 3 * 4, 4 * 5) = 60\nlcm(2 * 3 * 4, 3 * 4 * 5, 4 * 5 * 6) = 120\nlcm(2 * 3 * 4, 3 * 4 * 5, 4 * 5 * 6, 5 * 6 * 7) = 840</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/gcd\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>gcd</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes the greatest common divisor of two integers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::lcm","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Computes the least common multiple of the integers m and n."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"m, n"},{"label":"Return value","note":"If either m or n is zero, returns zero. Otherwise, returns the least common multiple of |m| and |n|."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws no exceptions."},{"label":"Notes"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"gcd","note":"computes the greatest common divisor of two integers"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":315,"codeBlockCount":2}
